AQQlFAxvu02sDygjCbPMqzVZkYkw7Od0unGTAxgFcwPfFw&oe=6AFDBC62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Demining Academy", "keywords": ["simulator", "mines", "sim"], "long_description": "**Demining Academy** is an experimental educational sandbox created to explore VR interaction mechanics and raise basic mine awareness. Set in a safe virtual environment, the simulation allows users to learn about unexploded ordnance (UXO) identification and safety protocols without real-world risk.\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Gameplay Progression\n- Level 0 - The Lobby Level: A safe zone to inspect 1:1 scale models of landmines and practice in detecting mines.\n- Level 1 - Surface Threats: Practice spotting visible surface-level hazards and executing remote destruction protocols from cover.\n- Level 2 - Sub-Surface Search: Sweep areas for hidden dangers and use realistic digging mechanics to carefully clear soil.\n\n### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features\n- Interactive Tool Belt: Utilize functional virtual tools tailored for spatial VR interactions.\n- Tactile Mechanics: Experience realistic digging physics and object manipulation.\n- Immersive Atmosphere: Spatial audio and full-body presence ground you in the environment.\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Important Disclaimer\nThis simulator is intended solely for educational, informational, and awareness purposes. The representations shown do not constitute certification, authorization, or official training for real-world explosive handling or hazardous device intervention.\nBy playing, you acknowledge that:\n- This experience is a simulation only.\n- You are not qualified to perform real demining operations.\n- Attempting to replicate these actions in the real world may result in serious injuries.", "short_description": "Demining Academy VR is an educational sandbox simulation that introduces players to basic mine awareness. Explore 1:1 scale models, learn standard safety protocols, and practice identifying virtual hazards in a safe, interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/TheDeiw/Demining-Academy/blob/main/Demining%20Academy%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TheDeiw's Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://thedeiw.github.io/TheDeiwGames/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1236651616193515"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562241525418058"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1562241525418058"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785747060, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562241525418058"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1263045200220823", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "27509373965382426", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1236651609526849", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1263045200220823"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": 